<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">  &quot;intro&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">: </span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">&quot;A short (1–3 sentence) narrative hook: context, stakes, outcome.&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">,</span></span>
